{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"toolshed_web_search","tool":"call_web_search","arguments":{"fast_mode":true,"web_search_instructions":"Search official Prodigi sources for black t-shirt product SKUs and sizes. Queries should include Prodigi SKU black t-shirt GLOBAL-TEE, Prodigi apparel API SKU t-shirt, and product catalogue CSV. Need exact base SKU and size/color variant mechanism."},"result":null,"error":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"toolshed_web_search","tool":"call_web_search","arguments":{"fast_mode":true,"web_search_instructions":"Search official Prodigi sources for black t-shirt product SKUs and sizes. Queries should include Prodigi SKU black t-shirt GLOBAL-TEE, Prodigi apparel API SKU t-shirt, and product catalogue CSV. Need exact base SKU and size/color variant mechanism."},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Research Report: Prodigi Black T-Shirt Product SKUs and Size/Color Variant Mechanism\n\n## Executive Summary\n\nProdigi offers a range of customizable t-shirts, including black variants, with specific SKUs and detailed size and color options. Their API provides comprehensive product details, including attributes and variant mechanisms, facilitating seamless integration for product management.\n\n## Key Findings\n\n- **Finding 1:** Prodigi's API allows retrieval of detailed product information, including SKUs, descriptions, dimensions, and available attributes such as color and size. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/reference/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Finding 2:** The SKU structure for t-shirts includes identifiers like `GLOBAL-TEE-BC-3001`, where `GLOBAL-TEE` denotes the product type, and additional codes specify brand and model. ([guardianbookshop.com](https://guardianbookshop.com/football-weekly-t-shirt/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Finding 3:** Product variants are managed through attributes within the API, allowing specification of options like color (e.g., black) and size (e.g., S, M, L, XL). ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/reference/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Finding 4:** Prodigi provides a CSV template for bulk product imports, detailing the required structure for product and variant information, streamlining catalog management. ([support.prodigycommerce.com](https://support.prodigycommerce.com/hc/en-us/articles/1500000157401-Importing-products?utm_source=openai))\n\n---\n\n## Detailed Source Analysis\n\n### Source 1: Prodigi API Documentation\n\n- **URL:** [https://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/reference/](https://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/reference/)\n\n- **Domain:** prodigi.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Official Documentation\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official documentation from Prodigi)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThe Prodigi API Documentation provides comprehensive details on accessing product information via their API. It outlines the structure of product details, including SKUs, descriptions, dimensions, attributes, and variants. The API allows retrieval of specific product data, facilitating integration and management of product catalogs.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- Example SKU: `GLOBAL-CAN-10X10`\n\n- Attributes include options like `wrap` with values such as \"Black\", \"ImageWrap\", \"MirrorWrap\", \"White\"\n\n- Variants specify attributes and shipping destinations\n\n- Print area dimensions provided for each variant\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"The Product Details endpoint returns all available data for a SKU, such as available destinations, attributes, and its required assets and dimensions.\"\n\n> \"The Product Details object contains all the information about each product you've requested.\"\n\n---\n\n### Source 2: Football Weekly T-shirt - The Guardian Bookshop\n\n- **URL:** [https://guardianbookshop.com/football-weekly-t-shirt/](https://guardianbookshop.com/football-weekly-t-shirt/)\n\n- **Domain:** guardianbookshop.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Commercial\n\n- **Credibility:** Medium (Product listing from a reputable retailer)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThis product listing showcases a t-shirt supplied by Prodigi, providing insight into SKU structuring and variant options. The SKU `GLOBAL-TEE-BC-3001` indicates a global t-shirt product, with `BC-3001` likely referring to the brand and model. Available sizes include S, M, L, and XL, with color options specified.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- SKU: `GLOBAL-TEE-BC-3001`\n\n- Sizes: S, M, L, XL\n\n- Color: Black\n\n- Supplier: Prodigi\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"Inspired by the hit Guardian podcast, our Football Weekly T-shirts are exclusively available at the Guardian Bookshop.\"\n\n> \"Supplier Name: Prodigi\"\n\n---\n\n### Source 3: Importing Products – Support\n\n- **URL:** [https://support.prodigycommerce.com/hc/en-us/articles/1500000157401-Importing-products](https://support.prodigycommerce.com/hc/en-us/articles/1500000157401-Importing-products)\n\n- **Domain:** prodigycommerce.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Support Documentation\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official support documentation)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThis support article details the process of importing products into a Prodigy store using a CSV file. It emphasizes the importance of adhering to the provided CSV template, which includes sample data for products and variants. The structure ensures correct integration of product information, including SKUs, attributes, and variant details.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- CSV template includes sample product and variant data\n\n- Emphasis on maintaining the structure of the CSV file\n\n- Guidance on downloading and completing the CSV template\n\n- Instructions for importing the completed CSV file\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"You can use a CSV (comma-separated values) file to import a large number of products and product variants to your Prodigy store.\"\n\n> \"Make sure that you enter your information into the CSV file with the same structure as the sample data in the Prodigy CSV Template.\"\n\n---\n\n## Cross-Reference Analysis\n\n**Consensus Across Sources:**\n\n- Prodigi's API provides detailed product information, including SKUs, attributes, and variants. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/reference/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- Product SKUs follow a structured format that includes product type and specific identifiers. ([guardianbookshop.com](https://guardianbookshop.com/football-weekly-t-shirt/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- CSV templates are available for bulk importing products, ensuring proper structure and integration. ([support.prodigycommerce.com](https://support.prodigycommerce.com/hc/en-us/articles/1500000157401-Importing-products?utm_source=openai))\n\n**Conflicting Information:**\n\n- No significant conflicting information was identified across the sources.\n\n**Information Gaps:**\n\n- Specific details on the complete SKU naming conventions and all possible attribute values are not fully detailed in the available sources. "}],"_meta":{"openai/widgetSessionId":"6044671e-cd70-4b20-8510-7d15b45825fb"},"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
