{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"toolshed_web_search","tool":"call_web_search","arguments":{"fast_mode":true,"web_search_instructions":"site:prodigi.com/products/ women's fitted t-shirt Prodigi black SKU; also site:prodigi.com \"Women's\" \"GLOBAL-TEE\". Return any exact Prodigi SKUs."},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Research Report: Prodigi Women's Fitted T-Shirt Black SKU; Women's GLOBAL-TEE\n\n## Executive Summary\n\nProdigi offers a range of women's fitted t-shirts, including the Bella+Canvas 6004 and Gildan 64000L models, both available in black. These t-shirts are identified by the SKUs GLOBAL-TEE-BC-6004 and GLOBAL-TEE-GIL-64000L, respectively. The term \"GLOBAL-TEE\" is used as a prefix in Prodigi's SKU system to denote globally fulfilled products.\n\n## Key Findings\n\n- **Finding 1:** The Bella+Canvas 6004 women's fitted t-shirt is available in black and carries the SKU GLOBAL-TEE-BC-6004. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/womens-clothing/t-shirts/classic/bella-canvas-6004/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Finding 2:** The Gildan 64000L women's fitted t-shirt is also available in black, with the SKU GLOBAL-TEE-GIL-64000L. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/womens-clothing/t-shirts/classic/gildan-64000l/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Finding 3:** The \"GLOBAL-TEE\" prefix in Prodigi's SKU system indicates products that are fulfilled globally. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/global/?utm_source=openai))\n\n---\n\n## Detailed Source Analysis\n\n### Source 1: Bella+Canvas 6004 Women's Favourite T-shirt\n\n- **URL:** ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/womens-clothing/t-shirts/classic/bella-canvas-6004/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Domain:** prodigi.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Commercial\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official product listing from Prodigi)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThe Bella+Canvas 6004 is a slim-fit women's t-shirt made from 100% combed and ring-spun cotton. It features a crew neck, short sleeves, and side seams for a tailored fit. The t-shirt is available in various colors, including black, and is identified by the SKU GLOBAL-TEE-BC-6004. This product supports additional features such as removable tags and multiple print areas, available at an extra cost.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- Material: 100% combed and ring-spun cotton\n\n- Fit: Slim\n\n- Available Colors: Black, among others\n\n- SKU: GLOBAL-TEE-BC-6004\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"This product also supports extra features, including removable tags and multiple print areas.\"\n\n---\n\n### Source 2: Gildan 64000L Women's SoftStyle Cotton T-shirt\n\n- **URL:** ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/womens-clothing/t-shirts/classic/gildan-64000l/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Domain:** prodigi.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Commercial\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official product listing from Prodigi)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThe Gildan 64000L is a semi-fitted women's t-shirt made from 100% ring-spun cotton. It features a crew neck, short sleeves, and side seams for a comfortable fit. The t-shirt is available in black and carries the SKU GLOBAL-TEE-GIL-64000L. Additional features like removable tags and multiple print areas are available at an extra cost.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- Material: 100% ring-spun cotton\n\n- Fit: Semi-fitted\n\n- Available Colors: Black, among others\n\n- SKU: GLOBAL-TEE-GIL-64000L\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"This product also supports extra features, including removable tags and multiple print areas.\"\n\n---\n\n### Source 3: Globally Fulfilled Product Catalogue\n\n- **URL:** ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/global/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **Domain:** prodigi.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Commercial\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official product catalogue from Prodigi)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nProdigi's globally fulfilled product catalogue includes various women's clothing items, such as the Bella+Canvas 6004 and Gildan 64000L t-shirts. The \"GLOBAL-TEE\" prefix in the SKU indicates that these products are available for global fulfillment, ensuring wide availability and consistent quality across different regions.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- Products: Bella+Canvas 6004, Gildan 64000L\n\n- SKU Prefix: GLOBAL-TEE\n\n- Fulfillment: Global\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"The 'GLOBAL-TEE' prefix in Prodigi's SKU system indicates products that are fulfilled globally.\"\n\n---\n\n## Cross-Reference Analysis\n\n**Consensus Across Sources:**\n\n- Both the Bella+Canvas 6004 and Gildan 64000L women's t-shirts are available in black and are identified by the SKUs GLOBAL-TEE-BC-6004 and GLOBAL-TEE-GIL-64000L, respectively. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/womens-clothing/t-shirts/classic/bella-canvas-6004/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- The \"GLOBAL-TEE\" prefix signifies products that are fulfilled globally by Prodigi. ([prodigi.com](https://www.prodigi.com/products/global/?utm_source=openai))\n\n**Conflicting Information:**\n\n- No conflicting information was found among the sources.\n\n**Information Gaps:**\n\n- Specific pricing details for the t-shirts are not provided in the available sources.\n\n- Information on the availability of these products in specific regions or countries is not detailed.\n\n---\n\n## Research Metadata\n\n- **Search Completed:** 2026-08-24T06:03:55Z\n\n- **Sources Analyzed:** 3 sources\n\n- **Total Content Reviewed:** Approximately 1,200 words\n\n- **Search Confidence:** High "}],"_meta":{"openai/widgetSessionId":"ad2d78d2-f3b1-4677-bc4b-6790dadf83ea"},"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
